# What a release build carries; never committed. Without the config that names them no build
# needs these folders, so the gates pass on a clean checkout.
#
# The seven programs (INS-002, S12 packaging 2.1; HMD-052): the builder's bundle step
# (src/builder/carried/) builds `anima`, `anima-local-hub`, `anima-hub`, `anima-database`,
# `anima-gateway` and `anima-daemon` with cargo and `anima-link` with `link/build.sh`, from the
# job's commit, puts `binaries/<program>-<target-triple>` here (and, on macOS,
# `<program>-universal-apple-darwin` made with lipo), and passes them in `bundle.externalBin`
# in `--config` to `tauri build` and `tauri bundle`. `anima-daemon` is the daemon that the
# application installs on the computer it runs on (MET-019, D-10 d).
/binaries/
#
# The PostgreSQL tree (S3 T11, S12 packaging 2.2): the bundle step runs
# `database-tree/build.sh`, which writes the tree here; `bundle.resources` carries it as
# `database`.
/database/
